  "body": "The links to the [ARIA](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/references.html#refsARIA) and the [HTML Accessibility API Mappings](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/references.html#refsHTMLAAM) specs in the References sections appear broken. Presumably, the W3C ARIA GitHub repo changed its structure. It seems that the correct links should be simply https://w3c.github.io/aria/ and https://w3c.github.io/html-aam/, respectively.\r\n\r\nIs it correct?",
